{"unit_id":"Drifter-yh__dsh-tool-policy#feature-1","repo":"Drifter-yh/dsh-tool-policy","commit":"542eba6606aefd96463887cb5561d30c2b6b107b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-policy 的功能「按工具名匹配规则」：对工具名使用完整匹配的星号通配模式，并按配置顺序采用首个匹配规则的决定。配置规则后，每次工具调用进入执行前流程时自动评估。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/policy.ts:25-35","src/policy.ts:103-110","src/policy.ts:222-239"]}
{"unit_id":"Drifter-yh__dsh-tool-policy#feature-2","repo":"Drifter-yh/dsh-tool-policy","commit":"542eba6606aefd96463887cb5561d30c2b6b107b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-policy 的功能「按参数条件匹配」：规则可通过 JSON Pointer 读取调用参数，并比较标量是否相等或字符串是否包含指定内容。条件匹配后返回对应决定，不匹配时继续评估后续规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/policy.ts:15-23","src/policy.ts:146-164","src/policy.ts:247-267"]}
{"unit_id":"Drifter-yh__dsh-tool-policy#feature-3","repo":"Drifter-yh/dsh-tool-policy","commit":"542eba6606aefd96463887cb5561d30c2b6b107b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-policy 的功能「调用前决定」：插件监听 tools/pre-execute，按评估结果继续后续处理、返回 ask 请求审批，或返回 deny 拒绝本次调用。它不会调用工具本身。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:100-121"]}
{"unit_id":"Drifter-yh__dsh-tool-policy#feature-4","repo":"Drifter-yh/dsh-tool-policy","commit":"542eba6606aefd96463887cb5561d30c2b6b107b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-policy 的功能「决策追踪」：启用 trace 后，工具调用评估完成时通过 Cordis logger 记录工具名、决定、匹配规则编号及必要原因，不记录解析后的参数；日志失败不会改变策略结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:49-59","src/index.ts:101-110"]}
{"unit_id":"Drifter-yh__dsh-tool-policy#caveat-1","repo":"Drifter-yh/dsh-tool-policy","commit":"542eba6606aefd96463887cb5561d30c2b6b107b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-policy 使用前须知：bundle 默认拒绝且规则为空，安装后应在 profile 配置规则；未命中的调用按默认决定处理（见 cordis.patch.yml:1-8、src/policy.ts:282-292）。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-8","src/policy.ts:282-292"]}
